The First Purge is a 2018 American dystopian action horror film serving as a
prequel to the The Purge film series and the fourth installment overall.

12
00:55:25,714 --> 00:55:31,714
Written by James DeMonaco and directed by Gerard McMurray, it is the
first film in the franchise not directed by DeMonaco.

13
01:00:02,857 --> 01:00:08,857
It stars Y'lan Noel, Lex Scott Davis, Joivan Wade, and Steve Harris.

14
01:04:40,000 --> 01:04:46,000
The film depicts the origins of the annual "Purge": a 12-hour period in which all crime in
America is decriminalized as a means to reduce crime for the rest of the year.

15
01:09:17,142 --> 01:09:23,142
The event originates as an experiment conceived by a political party called the New Founding Fathers of America and confined to Staten Island with the promise that those
who stay on the island for its duration will be paid a large sum of money, but the NFFA are determined to get the results they want by any means necessary.

16
01:13:54,285 --> 01:14:00,285
The First Purge was released on June 19, 2018, by Universal Pictures.

17
01:18:31,428 --> 01:18:37,428
It grossed over $137 million worldwide, becoming the highest-grossing entry in the
franchise, but received mixed reviews from critics like its predecessors.

